==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[pull]] [[teeth]]|pulls teeth|pulling teeth|pulled teeth}}
# {{label|en|dentistry}} To remove teeth, usually because they are diseased or damaged.
# {{label|en|idiomatic}} To do something that is especially [[difficult]] or [[effortful]], to [[get blood out of a stone]].
#: ''You will probably have to '''pull teeth''' to get a straight answer from a car salesman.''

